// CDLCOUNTERATTACK recognizes the Counterattack pattern over bars startIdx
// through endIdx.
//
// A two-candle pattern of two long, opposite-colored real bodies whose closing
// prices are (nearly) equal. Emits a bullish signal when the second candle is
// white and a bearish signal when it is black (a reversal signal, though its
// trend context is not checked).
//
// Formula and more info at https://ta-lib.org/functions/cdlcounterattack.
//
// Inputs, each at least endIdx+1 long:
//   - inOpen: Open price of each bar.
//   - inHigh: High price of each bar.
//   - inLow: Low price of each bar.
//   - inClose: Close price of each bar.
//
